      "settings": {
        "enable_dark": false,
        "subheading": "<p><strong>JOIN US</strong></p>",
        "title": "<p>A Study In Colour | Gemstone Trunkshow</p>",
        "description": "<p><strong> 2–4 October | Paddington Showroom</strong></p><p>For the first time, we invite you to experience <strong>A Study in Colour</strong> — Natalie Marie Jewellery’s inaugural Gemstone Trunk Show.</p><p>For three days only, discover a curated collection of one-of-a-kind natural gemstones, alongside exclusive finished pieces created especially for the occasion. Our most-loved signatures have been reimagined through colour, with new Eirene designs also making their debut.</p><p>From luminous yellow sapphires and Ceylon sapphires to vivid blue topaz and rich pink garnets, each gemstone has been selected for its individual colour, character and natural beauty.</p><p><strong>Friday 2 October</strong> marks the opening of A Study in Colour with an exclusive preview event, offering the first opportunity to discover the collection.</p><p><strong>Saturday 3 & Sunday 4 October</strong>, the Trunk Show will be open for walk-ins throughout the weekend, with dedicated Bespoke Appointments also available for those looking to explore the gemstone collection one-on-one with our team.</p>",
        "feature_text": "<p><em>Mark </em>a birth month, <em>honour </em>a milestone, <em>capture </em>the memory of a loved one, or be <em>guided </em>by the stone you can't leave behind.</p>",
        "colour_style": "dark",
        "button_1_metaobject": "",
